r employer brand Run an enhanced advert for 2 months Standard Advert 550 words Logo Included Featured in an email alert Branded header image Employer logo in search results Highlighted in search results Additional documents Video content included Find out more Standard Advert + 550 words Logo Included Featured in an email alert Branded header image Employer logo in search results Highlighted in search results Additional documents Video content included Find out more Enhanced Advert Unlimited words Logo Included Featured in an email alert Branded header image Employer logo in search results Highlighted in search results Additional documents Video content included Find out more Standard Advert Recruit on a budget Our primary advertising option includes: 550 words Logo included Featured in an email alert sent to relevant jobseekers Post a job Standard Advert + Make your job stand out with company branding This advertising option includes: 550 words Logo included Featured in an email alert sent to relevant jobseekers Branded header image Your logo included next to the job title in search results Post a job Enhanced Advert Increase visibility and showcase your employer brand This advertising option includes: Unlimited word count Logo included Featured in an email alert sent to relevant jobseekers Branded header image Your logo included next to the job title in search results Highlighted blue box in search Further particulars and additional logos Supports video content Post a job Hard to fill role? We have a solution. Whether you're recruiting for a niche role or hiring multiple candidates, we can help. Reach your target audience today with our products and services. Products and rates Copyright © jobs.ac.uk 1998 - 2026 Find a Job Find PhDs Career Advice Jobs by Email About Us Contact Us Terms of use Privacy Policy Cookie Policy Accessibility Statement Find a Job Find PhDs Career Advice Jobs by Email About Us Contact Us Terms of use Privacy Policy Cookie Policy Accessibility Statement Terms of use Privacy Policy Cookie Policy Accessibility Statement Copyright © jobs.ac.uk 1998 - 2026"
